id: insect-shell-doubled
name: Insect Shell (Doubled)
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Insect Shell (4)'s - the Natural Armor's Apparel Bonus doubled while it is had (gear.mjs naturalArmorFactor).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Insect Shell: your Natural Armor's Apparel Bonus doubled, till the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Insect Shell (4): Double the Apparel Bonus of your Insect Shell until the start of your next turn.

